(245,1,'University Registrar\'s Office','I requested for Official TOR and authenticated copy of TOR last October 3, 2025. I came today, Oct. 17, 2025, to pick-up the documents I requested. I was able to get the TOR, however, I had to photocopy the TOR myself and handed over the copy to the registrar office for the authentication and waited more than 30 minutes from the time I handed over the photocopy. There was no citizens charter to look for the timeframe or duration of the authentication. I gave them the photocopy at exactly 3:15pm and was able to get it 3:50pm. For alumni and professionals who needed to fall in line with the students for transactions like this, time is important. It could have been better if upon pick up, the registrar\'s office already did the photocopy of the document for authentication, not the requestor, and charging additional cost to the requestor.','Authentication of Documents','Neutral','General','Low','MMSU_Transformer_v3','2026-02-20 07:09:30','2026-02-20 07:09:30'),
