(962,1,'Quality Assurance','Sustain and improve to level up services.','Reporting and Disseminating Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Results;Providing Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Status;Conducting Mock Accreditation of Academic Programs (for Program Accreditation);Processing Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Documents and Requirements (Program Accreditation, Institutional Accreditation, Institutional Sustainability Assessment, PQA, ISO, QS);Monitoring of Action Plans or Actions Taken to Address Findings/ Recommendations;','Positive','General','Low','MMSU_Transformer_v3','2026-02-20 08:17:32','2026-02-20 08:17:32'),
(963,1,'Quality Assurance','There could be a closer monitoring for accreditation. The difference, though minimal, between an instrument for BS and BA was only made known when the accreditation week was already near. Also, there was no template documents even for Level 1 Accreditation. There could be a ready template accessible to all team members, where spots for department-specific documents/evidence are indicated (as there are a lot of areas for university/institutional docs/evidence.) If there is, it did not reach the department. There must be a set of clearer instructions for all steps in the accreditation process. No instruction were given for PPP and compliance report, at least for us. With the many years of accreditation, there could be a set of clearer instructions for programs to undergo accreditation. Also, request for documents from various offices was decentralized, which was laborious; there could be a better way. Nonetheless, QA office was responsive to inquiries.','Providing Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Status;Conducting Mock Accreditation of Academic Programs (for Program Accreditation);Processing Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Documents and Requirements (Program Accreditation, Institutional Accreditation, Institutional Sustainability Assessment, PQA, ISO, QS);','Neutral','General','Low','MMSU_Transformer_v3','2026-02-20 08:17:33','2026-02-20 08:17:33'),
(964,1,'Quality Assurance','must have the file or data base for all common documents needed for accreditation so that the program to be accredited does not need to request these documents to various offices, for easy facilitattion of the accreditation.','Processing Accreditation/Certification/Assessment Documents and Requirements (Program Accreditation, Institutional Accreditation, Institutional Sustainability Assessment, PQA, ISO, QS);','Neutral','General','Low','MMSU_Transformer_v3','2026-02-20 08:17:34','2026-02-20 08:17:34'),
